    "chunk_text": "dyde. & he cw\u00e6\u00fe to \u00feam H\u00e6lende, Drihten, gemun \u00feu me \u00feonne \u00feu cymst on \u00fein rice. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6lend to him, Tod\u00e6g \u00feu bist mid me on paradiso. \u00dea w\u00e6s nean seo syxte tid, & \u00feystro w\u00e6ron ofer ealle eor\u00fean o\u00f0 \u00fea nigo\u00fean tide, & sunne w\u00e6s \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend clypiende mycelre stefne, F\u00e6der ic bebeode minne gast on \u00feinre handa, & \u00feus \u00dea se hundredman geseah \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fear geworden w\u00e6s, he God wuldrode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, So\u00felice \u00fees man w\u00e6s & eall wered \u00fee \u00e6t \u00feisse w\u00e6fersynne w\u00e6ron & gesawon \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee gewurdon, w\u00e6ron agen \u00d0a stodon ealle hys cu\u00fean feorran, & \u00fea wif \u00fee him fyligdon fram Galilea \u00feas \u00feing geseonde. & \u00fea an man on naman Iosep, se w\u00e6s gerefa god wer & rihtwis. \u00dees ne ge\u00few\u00e6rode hyra ge\u00feeahte & hyra d\u00e6dum fram Arimathia Iudea ceastre se sylfa geanbidude \u00dees geneal\u00e6hte to Pilate & b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes lichaman, & ny\u00f0eralede hyne & on scytan befeold & And \u00fea w\u00e6s se d\u00e6g Parasceue \u00fe\u00e6t is gegearwunge, & s\u00e6terd\u00e6g onlyhte. \u00d0a wif \u00fee him fyligdon \u00fee comon mid him of Galilea hig gesawon \u00fea byrgene, & hu his lichama & gearwodun wyrtgemang & sealfa & on s\u00e6ternd\u00e6g hig gestildon \u00e6fter bebode. On anum rested",
